      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is especially useful with the latest hand tracking update for quest 2, especially with there being a standalone app. \nThis would do absolute wonders for the ASL community, both within and without VR, as people would be able to learn full ASL/BSL in VR and then apply it in real life.",
